WEBVTT

00:00:01.252 --> 00:00:05.464
Ima kara utau koto koko dake no hanashi ni

00:00:06.924 --> 00:00:08.926
<i>Shite oite ne</i>

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:14.724
<i>Yokubou wa kokoro ni
kakushite okitai no hontou wa</i>

00:00:14.807 --> 00:00:16.851
<i>Himitsu himitsu</i>

00:00:33.117 --> 00:00:35.703
<i>Chikamichi shitai</i>

00:00:35.786 --> 00:00:39.582
<i>Ame ni nureru koto naku</i>

00:00:39.665 --> 00:00:43.211
Kaze ni tobasareru koto naku

00:00:43.294 --> 00:00:47.006
Zurugashikokute mo waratte ne

00:00:47.089 --> 00:00:51.469
<i>Hikyoumono demo asonde ne</i>

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:55.056
Kanashimitakunai

00:00:55.139 --> 00:00:58.935
Namida ni nureru koto naku

00:00:59.018 --> 00:01:02.563
<i>Tohou ni kureru koto</i> naku

00:01:02.647 --> 00:01:06.025
Donkan datte waratte ne

00:01:06.108 --> 00:01:11.072
<i>Tanoshii koto dake oshiete ne</i>

00:01:14.825 --> 00:01:19.372
<i>Mitai kao ga aru no kikitai koe ga aru no</i>

00:01:20.581 --> 00:01:24.252
Me <i>ga</i> sametara yorokobi wo narashite

00:01:24.335 --> 00:01:30.299
<i>Ohayou, kyou mo yoroshiku onegai itashimasu</i>

00:01:30.299 --> 00:01:30.967
"Princess Jellyfish"

00:01:35.179 --> 00:01:36.639
Good morning, everyone.

00:01:36.722 --> 00:01:42.228
Sakurako, Midoriko, O-Chiyo,
Matsuko, O-Take, Umeko, Yoshibo...

00:01:42.311 --> 00:01:44.522
You're all looking as well as ever.

00:01:44.605 --> 00:01:46.190
Morning!

00:01:46.274 --> 00:01:49.235
Chieko, I have a favor to ask you!

00:01:49.318 --> 00:01:51.654
You're certainly here early this morning.

00:01:51.737 --> 00:01:57.326
Yep. I have a lot to do today.
So, I'd like to borrow that...

00:01:57.410 --> 00:01:59.245
Ah, yes, that.

00:01:59.328 --> 00:02:02.999
Here. You can play, but be nice, won't you?

00:02:03.082 --> 00:02:06.585
Like I want to play with some doll! I mean that!

00:02:07.795 --> 00:02:09.380
The machine?

00:02:21.726 --> 00:02:26.397
<i>Oh, right... Last night I drank
some sweet sake in the kitchen...</i>

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:29.900
<i>And then Mom carried me to bed...</i>

00:02:31.902 --> 00:02:33.321
A dream?

00:02:33.404 --> 00:02:36.365
"Days of Love and Lukewarm Water"

00:02:36.782 --> 00:02:41.662
<i>I dreamed about you last night, Mom.</i>

00:02:41.746 --> 00:02:48.294
<i>But if that was a dream, how
did I get back to my own room'?</i>

00:02:48.377 --> 00:02:50.379
You're up early this morning, Tsukimi!

00:02:50.463 --> 00:02:52.089
Oh, good morning.

00:02:52.173 --> 00:02:55.092
Your drinking last night was most impressive!

00:02:55.176 --> 00:03:01.390
Um, anyway, I don't really
remember how I got back to my room...

00:03:02.224 --> 00:03:07.146
You say the great Guan Yu's spirit
shepherded you safely to your room?!

00:03:07.229 --> 00:03:09.523
Leave it to the sweet sake of Guan Yu!

00:03:09.607 --> 00:03:11.484
That's not quite...

00:03:11.567 --> 00:03:12.485
Stop it!

00:03:12.568 --> 00:03:14.236
Aw, no worries.

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:16.489
I did this in Home Ec class in middle school!

00:03:16.572 --> 00:03:17.448
I'm telling you, no!

00:03:17.531 --> 00:03:22.161
--That machine only responds well for me.
--Hmm, maybe this goes here?

00:03:22.161 --> 00:03:23.079
--No, no!
--Hmm, maybe this goes here?

00:03:23.162 --> 00:03:25.581
If you do that, the bobbin thread will--

00:03:25.664 --> 00:03:27.166
Gah, it got all tangled!

00:03:27.249 --> 00:03:30.127
--Oh, now look what you've done!
--VVh-What are you doing?

00:03:30.211 --> 00:03:33.756
Tsukimi! Please, stop her!

00:03:33.839 --> 00:03:37.468
Oh, so you're awake. ls your fever better?

00:03:37.551 --> 00:03:38.928
Fever?

00:03:39.011 --> 00:03:42.390
<i>Oh, right, I was a little feverish last night...</i>

00:03:42.473 --> 00:03:45.142
<i>Huh? But how does he know'?</i>

00:03:45.226 --> 00:03:48.312
Blech, I don't get this thing.
We'll start over here instead.

00:03:48.396 --> 00:03:53.359
I bought this stuff first thing this morning.
Look! Fabric! Rhinestones! And lace and beads!

00:03:53.442 --> 00:03:54.568
O-Okay...?

00:03:54.652 --> 00:03:55.945
Come on, let's do it!

00:03:56.028 --> 00:03:57.947
Do... what?

00:03:58.030 --> 00:03:59.573
For crying out loud!

00:03:59.657 --> 00:04:03.327
I told you, we're going to make this!

00:04:03.411 --> 00:04:06.372
You want to make... a flower hat jelly?

00:04:06.455 --> 00:04:08.749
No! A skirt!

00:04:08.833 --> 00:04:12.753
Um... this is a design I drew in high school...

00:04:12.837 --> 00:04:16.340
I know! But it looks like a skirt to me!

00:04:16.424 --> 00:04:18.217
If we make a skirt just like this,

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:19.969
I know it'll be cute, and we can sell it!

00:04:20.052 --> 00:04:23.055
We can take over Japan!
We can save Amamizu-kan!

00:04:23.139 --> 00:04:26.350
The point is, I want to
make one of these with this!

00:04:26.434 --> 00:04:27.518
Chieko, make it!

00:04:27.601 --> 00:04:31.397
Impossible! I can only make traditional clothing.

00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:34.024
And I only use this machine to stitch yukata.

00:04:34.108 --> 00:04:39.238
Yukata... You mean you made that, too?
Whoa! Chieko, you're a god!

00:04:39.321 --> 00:04:42.908
Oh, you flatter me. Anyone could do this much.

00:04:42.992 --> 00:04:43.826
How do you do it?

00:04:43.909 --> 00:04:45.578
There's nothing to it!

00:04:45.661 --> 00:04:47.079
Oh, I know.

00:04:47.163 --> 00:04:52.668
Look, I've just started making
a new kimono for Midoriko.

00:04:53.502 --> 00:04:54.503
She's fast!

00:04:54.587 --> 00:04:55.880
The type of needlework
used in traditional clothing

00:04:55.963 --> 00:04:57.590
is a refined technique passed
down in Japan since ancient times

00:04:57.673 --> 00:04:59.842
which only employs straight lines.

00:04:59.925 --> 00:05:02.094
Western-style clothing is a world of curved lines

00:05:02.178 --> 00:05:04.305
designed to accommodate
the wearer's body shape,

00:05:04.388 --> 00:05:07.391
so it's completely different,
even on a conceptual level.

00:05:07.475 --> 00:05:09.185
You're super-sewing without
even looking at your hands!

00:05:09.268 --> 00:05:10.936
I'm telling you, you could do this!

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:13.397
--No way, no way, no way, no way!
--Why not?!

00:05:13.481 --> 00:05:16.066
As I said, Japanese and Western
sewing are completely different,

00:05:16.150 --> 00:05:17.485
from different schools of thought.

00:05:17.568 --> 00:05:18.944
If you'd like an analogy,

00:05:19.028 --> 00:05:21.030
they're about as different as
Tokyo-style sushi and French cuisine.

00:05:21.113 --> 00:05:26.327
In other words, you're essentially
asking a sushi chef to make a terrine.

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:28.537
She's sewing and being a total
font of knowledge at the same time!

00:05:28.621 --> 00:05:31.999
The point is, I can't possibly
make something so complicated.

00:05:32.082 --> 00:05:34.335
If I do help you, it'll only be with stitching.

00:05:34.418 --> 00:05:36.879
You manage the rest of it yourselves.

00:05:37.463 --> 00:05:39.840
"Manage" it, she says...

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:43.802
"Amamizu Area Redevelopment
Entrepreneur Debriefing Session"

00:05:43.802 --> 00:05:47.598
we'll now cover the situation on
the west side of Amamizu Station,

00:05:47.681 --> 00:05:49.975
where construction is planned.

00:05:50.059 --> 00:05:53.521
Our company is in continuing
negotiations with the residents

00:05:53.604 --> 00:05:57.399
so that we can break ground
the year after next at the latest.

00:05:57.483 --> 00:06:01.779
The site purchase is going
well and proceeding on schedule.

00:06:01.862 --> 00:06:05.658
<i>Amamizu-kan... It's right in
the middle of the proposed site.</i>

00:06:05.741 --> 00:06:08.577
<i>This buyout means that
before long, Tsukimi will...</i>

00:06:11.163 --> 00:06:12.665
What? I'm being evicted?

00:06:12.748 --> 00:06:15.209
Yes, unfortunately.

00:06:15.292 --> 00:06:19.964
But if they won't let me live here...
I've got nowhere else to go...!

00:06:20.047 --> 00:06:24.385
It's all right, Tsukimi.
Let's make a home together!

00:06:24.468 --> 00:06:26.053
Together?

00:06:27.137 --> 00:06:29.306
We'll rent a little house by the shore...

00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:34.019
...and live humble, quiet lives
together watching the jellyfish.

00:06:34.019 --> 00:06:43.279
<i>If I were to build</i> a <i>house</i>

00:06:43.362 --> 00:06:52.705
<i>Beside the puppy, YOU, YOU</i>

00:06:52.788 --> 00:06:56.792
I'd want you to be th--

00:06:56.792 --> 00:06:57.626
That'll never happen.

00:06:57.710 --> 00:07:00.754
You had sex with me.

00:07:04.758 --> 00:07:06.552
I-I'm sorry!

00:07:08.304 --> 00:07:09.763
Tsukimi Kurashita?

00:07:09.847 --> 00:07:12.891
Yeah. Mr. Koibuchi insists...

00:07:12.975 --> 00:07:16.270
And Shu leaves tonight for
a tour of inspection overseas,

00:07:16.353 --> 00:07:17.855
so there's no danger of him finding out.

00:07:17.938 --> 00:07:20.524
So you don't have a photo.

00:07:20.608 --> 00:07:22.109
What's her address?

00:07:30.576 --> 00:07:32.369
H-How many meters did you buy?

00:07:32.453 --> 00:07:35.789
No clue. I bought the whole bolt.

00:07:35.873 --> 00:07:37.041
Anyway, let's try cutting it!

00:07:37.124 --> 00:07:39.918
Huh? Are you sure that's a good process...?

00:07:40.002 --> 00:07:42.713
No clue. But we've gotta do something.

00:07:42.796 --> 00:07:44.840
But to just up and start cutting...

00:07:44.923 --> 00:07:48.177
You may be a Stylish, but you know
nothing about how clothes are made.

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:51.305
Yep, I just wear them.

00:07:52.890 --> 00:07:54.099
Fabric!

00:07:54.183 --> 00:07:56.727
--White fabric!
--lketani!

00:07:56.810 --> 00:08:00.606
"Chikuwa roll! A chikuwa roll!
--A white flag! Raise a white flag for Ma Chao!

00:08:00.689 --> 00:08:04.610
It's useless to fight Liu Bei's
army if Ma Chao fights with them!

00:08:04.693 --> 00:08:06.278
Don't get in the way!

00:08:06.362 --> 00:08:09.657
Special Attack: "Take this
and go buy something tasty!"

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:12.785
Ichiyo Higuchi!

00:08:13.911 --> 00:08:15.412
We're going to Chinatown!

00:08:15.496 --> 00:08:17.831
The Minatomirai Line will be mine!

00:08:20.834 --> 00:08:23.128
Problem solved! Okay, shall we?

00:08:32.221 --> 00:08:33.806
Cut, Tsukimi!

00:08:33.889 --> 00:08:35.224
B-But...

00:08:35.307 --> 00:08:36.767
It doesn't have to be exact.

00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:40.312
Just snip-snip-snip along
my body so it'll make a skirt!

00:08:40.396 --> 00:08:42.356
If it doesn't work, we'll
figure something out then!

00:08:42.439 --> 00:08:48.821
<i>Mom... Why is this person so beautiful'?</i>

00:08:48.904 --> 00:08:53.117
<i>His arms and legs are so pale and slender...</i>

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:55.953
<i>He's just like a jellyfish.</i>

00:09:00.165 --> 00:09:02.042
Make it like that whatsit-jelly.

00:09:02.126 --> 00:09:03.877
That's "flower hat jelly."

00:09:03.961 --> 00:09:06.004
Yeah, that one.

00:09:06.255 --> 00:09:14.888
<i>Looking at this beautiful person,
my heart is filled with jellyfish lace.</i>

00:09:14.972 --> 00:09:18.058
<i>It's almost enough to make
me forget about the bad things...</i>

00:09:20.060 --> 00:09:21.520
Good afternoon!

00:09:21.603 --> 00:09:22.813
Hello.

00:09:22.896 --> 00:09:24.398
What are you up to after this?

00:09:24.481 --> 00:09:28.360
I'm going back to the office to
put today's information in order.

00:09:38.203 --> 00:09:39.037
I want to see the ocean...

00:09:39.121 --> 00:09:40.247
Please get out.

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:43.292
--Let's go to--
--Please get out!

00:09:43.375 --> 00:09:46.170
What do you want?!

00:09:46.253 --> 00:09:47.796
I understand.

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:50.549
You intend to treat that
night as a one-night stand...

00:09:50.632 --> 00:09:57.097
If that's what you want, fine. I'll go home.

00:09:57.181 --> 00:10:00.309
Inari-Style <i>Elite</i> Man Snaring
Techniques: Beginners' Course.

00:10:00.392 --> 00:10:03.562
<i>If pushing doesn't work, try a
combination of pulling and gentle threats.</i>

00:10:03.645 --> 00:10:06.398
<i>He's guaranteed to call me
in the next two or three</i> da--

00:10:06.482 --> 00:10:07.566
Wait, please!

00:10:07.649 --> 00:10:08.609
<i>That was fast!</i>

00:10:08.692 --> 00:10:12.654
<i>That's a virgin for you. He takes
the bait as fast as a middle school kid!</i>

00:10:12.738 --> 00:10:15.949
--But <i>I'll boldly ignore him!
--Taxi!</i>

00:10:16.033 --> 00:10:17.409
Wait, please!

00:10:24.708 --> 00:10:25.501
It's commercial time!

00:10:25.584 --> 00:10:26.543
Clara!

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:29.046
It's the second half!

00:10:29.129 --> 00:10:29.963
Tequila!

00:10:30.964 --> 00:10:32.883
There's only 535 yen left!

00:10:32.966 --> 00:10:36.178
To think Ichiyo Higuchi
didn't even last us half the day...!

00:10:36.261 --> 00:10:39.515
That's because you said we
should add on mango flan.

00:10:39.598 --> 00:10:42.476
All right, now we go pay our
respects to the spirit of Guan Yu

00:10:42.559 --> 00:10:45.062
"before rounding the night off
with a trip to a deluxe public bath!

00:10:45.062 --> 00:10:46.939
--VVhoa! "before rounding the night off
with a trip to a deluxe public bath!

00:10:48.315 --> 00:10:50.776
This afro is totally righteous!

00:10:50.859 --> 00:10:53.320
It's bigger than the sukimaswitch guy's!

00:10:53.403 --> 00:10:57.157
Hey, can I touch it?
I'm already touching it, actually!

00:10:57.241 --> 00:10:59.409
A Stylish!

00:10:59.493 --> 00:11:02.204
Can I snap a pic?!

00:11:02.287 --> 00:11:06.959
Listen, you two. I'll get right to the point:

00:11:07.042 --> 00:11:10.838
This thing was a 1000% failure
from the moment you cut the fabric.

00:11:10.921 --> 00:11:11.713
Huh?

00:11:11.797 --> 00:11:16.218
Don't take the wind out of our
sails when we've just started, Chieko!

00:11:16.301 --> 00:11:18.679
Well, I'll stitch it for you, but...

00:11:19.847 --> 00:11:21.431
But she's still breaking the sound barrier!

00:11:21.515 --> 00:11:23.684
And I'll put some elastic in...

00:11:23.767 --> 00:11:27.354
Ugh, don't give my haute
couture skirt an elastic waistband!

00:11:27.437 --> 00:11:29.898
Just try it on this way.

00:11:29.982 --> 00:11:31.984
This...?

00:11:32.067 --> 00:11:36.405
This spring, rock the pauper look in
a flimsy skirt with an elastic waistband!

00:11:36.488 --> 00:11:38.407
More like, it's all wrong!

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:42.244
--Why isn't it floofy? Sheesh...
--With the pattern you cut,

00:11:42.327 --> 00:11:44.288
there's no way it could be!

00:11:44.913 --> 00:11:46.498
--It's wrong!
--Huh?

00:11:46.582 --> 00:11:50.961
That isn't expressing any of the
delicate beauty of the flower hat jelly!

00:11:51.044 --> 00:11:54.798
Not one micrometer! Not one nanometer!

00:11:54.882 --> 00:11:59.303
Uh-oh, here we go: the
monotonous ranting peculiar to geeks.

00:11:59.386 --> 00:12:03.098
First off, the cubic structure
of the bells of all jellyfish,

00:12:03.181 --> 00:12:06.018
not just the flower hat jelly, is like--!

00:12:09.479 --> 00:12:12.065
If that's what you want, fine.

00:12:12.566 --> 00:12:15.652
Sorry, I can't come to the phone right now.

00:12:17.487 --> 00:12:19.364
Tsukimi, what are you...?

00:12:19.448 --> 00:12:21.283
Please stay still.

00:12:22.993 --> 00:12:24.244
OW!

00:12:24.328 --> 00:12:26.413
Hey, whoa, aren't you going to apologize?

00:12:26.496 --> 00:12:28.457
Er, Tsukimi?

00:12:29.917 --> 00:12:32.961
It's okay. You don't have to stop her.

00:12:34.755 --> 00:12:37.215
Done!

00:12:37.299 --> 00:12:40.260
Now it looks a little bit like a bell, anyway.

00:12:40.344 --> 00:12:42.721
Why, you're right. Not bad!

00:12:42.804 --> 00:12:45.432
Chieko, could I ask you
to sew it on the machine?

00:12:45.515 --> 00:12:48.185
That's fine, but what do
you want to do with the edges?

00:12:48.268 --> 00:12:50.228
You've got margins on the front.

00:12:50.312 --> 00:12:52.064
Oh, that's okay.

00:12:52.147 --> 00:12:54.900
As long as it's shaped like a bell,
that's good enough for me.

00:12:54.983 --> 00:12:57.903
But you know, I don't
think this will be floofy enough

00:12:57.986 --> 00:12:59.696
unless I wear a pannier underneath...

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:01.114
Pa... what?

00:13:01.198 --> 00:13:05.410
"Pannier." That thing Goth-Ioli
girls wear under their skirts

00:13:05.494 --> 00:13:07.454
that looks like a ballerina's tutu.

00:13:07.537 --> 00:13:09.247
L-| don't...

00:13:09.331 --> 00:13:13.377
I know, let's do this at my place,
since I have some there.

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:17.756
My brother's off on his trip
abroad today, so the timing's perfect!

00:13:17.839 --> 00:13:19.424
Brother...

00:13:31.144 --> 00:13:32.729
Tsukimi?

00:13:34.940 --> 00:13:35.857
Chieko.

00:13:35.941 --> 00:13:36.650
What?

00:13:36.692 --> 00:13:41.029
Doll fans like to visit lots of old
estates and take pictures, right?

00:13:41.113 --> 00:13:43.115
Yes, would you like to see?

00:13:43.198 --> 00:13:46.076
I recently went to a
Western-style house in Kamakura...

00:13:46.159 --> 00:13:47.744
Look.

00:13:47.828 --> 00:13:50.747
“Oh, my!
--I have a favor to ask.

00:13:53.375 --> 00:13:57.170
Thanks a bunch! Can I post this on my blog?

00:13:57.254 --> 00:13:58.630
B-Blog?

00:13:58.714 --> 00:14:00.382
Afros really are great, aren't they?

00:14:00.465 --> 00:14:03.301
Where did you get yours done?
Aoyama? Was it Aoyama?

00:14:03.385 --> 00:14:05.178
Th-This is natural...

00:14:05.262 --> 00:14:10.017
I've always thought they were so cool,
but my agency won't let me get one!

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:13.228
Can I touch it one more time? Thanks a bunch!

00:14:14.563 --> 00:14:18.358
This one, eh? Not a bad place to live.

00:14:20.068 --> 00:14:25.240
Excuse me, sir! Do you know
where I can find this address?

00:14:25.323 --> 00:14:27.325
Oh, if that's what you're looking for--

00:14:28.702 --> 00:14:33.749
Jeez, those guys always
make me drink too damn much!

00:14:33.832 --> 00:14:37.044
And who the hell recommends
Dom Pérignon Rose these days?!

00:14:38.587 --> 00:14:40.630
Twelve messages.

00:14:40.714 --> 00:14:46.094
Hmm, what to do... Ah, this salami is good.

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:52.601
It's ringing again! Fine, whatever, I'll answer...

00:14:52.684 --> 00:14:53.477
Yeah?

00:14:53.518 --> 00:14:55.687
U-Um, hello! This is Koibuchi.

00:14:55.771 --> 00:14:58.857
Didn't I say I wouldn't contact you again?

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:02.027
Well, yes, but...

00:15:02.110 --> 00:15:03.070
Crap...

00:15:03.153 --> 00:15:04.154
Pardon?

00:15:04.237 --> 00:15:08.366
I've had too many... My head's all fuzzy...

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:13.080
I'm done for... Can't do a...
of these... had too many...

00:15:13.163 --> 00:15:16.833
Too... Too many of what? Hello? Hello!

00:15:16.917 --> 00:15:19.252
Don't do anything rash! <i>I'll</i> be right there!

00:15:19.336 --> 00:15:21.171
--So--don't be rash! I'll be right there!
--Huh?

00:15:21.254 --> 00:15:25.008
"Rash"... You stupid or somethin'?!

00:15:25.092 --> 00:15:29.054
Like anybody'd kill 'emselves
over gettin' dumped by you.

00:15:29.137 --> 00:15:31.723
This is the prollem with virgins...

00:15:41.358 --> 00:15:44.402
Goodness! Perfect Taisho Romance style!

00:15:46.571 --> 00:15:49.074
Treasure! It's a treasure trove!

00:15:49.157 --> 00:15:53.161
I told you we had a billion
old man photos, didn't I?

00:15:55.872 --> 00:16:00.877
So have you finally resigned
yourself to making a jellyfish dress?

00:16:02.754 --> 00:16:04.339
Tsukimi.

00:16:05.048 --> 00:16:06.591
Please let me go home.

00:16:06.675 --> 00:16:10.428
Why are you being so stubborn?
I told you, Bro's not here...

00:16:10.512 --> 00:16:15.016
I don't want to. I... don't
want to do that stuff anymore.

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:18.812
I don't want to get heated up
or go cold over little things...

00:16:18.895 --> 00:16:20.939
I'm sick of it.

00:16:21.022 --> 00:16:24.943
A lukewarm life is enough for me.

00:16:25.026 --> 00:16:27.654
I want to see it.

00:16:27.737 --> 00:16:31.283
I want to take this jellyfish
you drew and make it real.

00:16:31.366 --> 00:16:35.162
<i>I</i> want to see that.

00:16:35.245 --> 00:16:37.581
Why?

00:16:37.664 --> 00:16:38.790
Because it's beautiful.

00:16:38.874 --> 00:16:40.834
I'm just overcome!

00:16:41.877 --> 00:16:46.047
--Oh, this room is lovely, too!
--Wonderful!

00:16:47.674 --> 00:16:48.550
Jeez, be careful.

00:16:48.633 --> 00:16:51.678
I'm sorry! I just got a bit excited...

00:16:51.761 --> 00:16:54.639
Eh, it's okay. So, what do
you think? It's a cute room, right?

00:16:54.723 --> 00:16:56.349
It's divine!

00:16:56.433 --> 00:16:58.226
--I wish I'd brought Midoriko and the others!

00:16:58.226 --> 00:17:00.187
--If...
--I wish I'd brought Midoriko and the others!

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:05.233
<i>If I could give the feeling of that
moment not just</i> a <i>drawing, but</i> a <i>shape...</i>

00:17:05.317 --> 00:17:10.739
<i>a shape, with my own two hands...</i>

00:17:14.326 --> 00:17:16.536
Hey. Tsuki--mi?!

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:18.580
Chieko! Jiji!

00:17:19.331 --> 00:17:21.208
Lend me your aid!

00:17:39.059 --> 00:17:40.644
No...

00:17:44.648 --> 00:17:46.441
Psych!

00:17:46.524 --> 00:17:50.070
Did I scare you? These are just vitamins.

00:17:55.533 --> 00:17:57.118
What?

00:18:00.622 --> 00:18:04.709
Ow! hey, stop, STOP, STOP!

00:18:06.127 --> 00:18:09.256
It was just a joke!
You don't have to get so ma--

00:18:27.399 --> 00:18:31.403
Huh, that was fast.
She was dead after all, then?

00:18:31.486 --> 00:18:32.779
Come on, let's get away.

00:18:32.862 --> 00:18:34.406
Take me to Narita, please.

00:18:34.489 --> 00:18:35.699
Skipping town, I see.

00:18:35.782 --> 00:18:36.950
I'm asking you to take me to Narita!

00:18:37.033 --> 00:18:38.618
Yes, Sir.

00:18:40.245 --> 00:18:42.622
She wasn't dead.

00:18:43.873 --> 00:18:45.500
I'm finished over here.

00:18:45.583 --> 00:18:48.295
Okay, then do this too, please.

00:18:50.463 --> 00:18:52.465
Crap, I fell asleep.

00:18:52.549 --> 00:18:54.718
These pearls are beautiful, though, aren't they?

00:18:54.801 --> 00:18:57.512
For imitations, they're pretty high-quality.

00:18:57.595 --> 00:18:59.848
Now if I just put these here...!

00:18:59.931 --> 00:19:02.434
Tsukimi... that...

00:19:02.517 --> 00:19:04.311
All done.

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:10.817
We finished it!

00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:14.821
The Sisterhood Human Wave
Attack managed to get it done!

00:19:15.947 --> 00:19:18.283
Fine detail work really
stiffens up your shoulders!

00:19:18.366 --> 00:19:22.620
I'd love the Kita no Kuni Kara
DVD box set as my reward.

00:19:28.418 --> 00:19:30.211
Hey, it's cute!

00:19:30.295 --> 00:19:35.300
Yes, this is the pop idol of the
jellyfish world: the flower hat jelly!

00:19:35.383 --> 00:19:39.054
The tentacles came out well, too!

00:19:39.137 --> 00:19:42.724
Hey, can I try it on? I'm trying it on!

00:19:42.807 --> 00:19:44.642
Hmm? Oh, yeah...

00:19:44.726 --> 00:19:47.312
Tsukimi tore the necklace...

00:19:47.395 --> 00:19:49.939
They're imitation pearls anyway, aren't they?

00:19:50.023 --> 00:19:52.817
No, they're real... they're
probably worth a few million yen...

00:19:52.901 --> 00:19:55.904
What?! Then each pearl
is at least ten thousand?!

00:19:55.987 --> 00:19:59.741
L-|-I'm so sorry! I wasn't thinking!

00:19:59.824 --> 00:20:04.412
I just thought they were perfect
for flower hat jelly tentacles, so I...

00:20:04.496 --> 00:20:06.331
It's okay.

00:20:06.414 --> 00:20:11.127
Turning it into a cute dress like
this would make Mom happy, too.

00:20:12.754 --> 00:20:14.798
Mama...

00:20:14.881 --> 00:20:18.551
<i>If I were a girl...</i>

00:20:18.635 --> 00:20:23.556
I'll give you this, too. It's something
I got from your papa anyway.

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:25.225
I can really have it?

00:20:27.018 --> 00:20:33.274
I wish you were a girl.
Then your Papa wouldn't...

00:20:33.358 --> 00:20:37.570
<i>If I'd been</i> a <i>princess-like girl, would</i> I...

00:20:37.654 --> 00:20:40.907
<i>Would I have gotten to
live with my mama forever?</i>

00:20:51.501 --> 00:20:53.670
I didn't expect us to spend
the whole night out on the town!

00:20:53.753 --> 00:20:56.297
We only did because you
wouldn't get out of the electric bath

00:20:56.381 --> 00:20:57.799
in time for the last train.

00:20:57.882 --> 00:21:00.385
Sorry! I calculated that shock
therapy would be the best way

00:21:00.468 --> 00:21:05.140
to wash away any Stylish juice
that the Stylish got on us... Huh?

00:21:13.231 --> 00:21:14.941
What's this?

00:21:15.024 --> 00:21:17.819
Don't tell me that Baidi...

00:21:17.902 --> 00:21:19.404
...has fallen?!

00:21:20.905 --> 00:21:29.914
<i>Hontou ni kizuite hoshii n da,
anata ga utsukushii tte koto wo</i>

00:21:29.998 --> 00:21:34.335
Ima made naze kizukanai no sa

00:21:34.419 --> 00:21:38.840
<i>Kokoro nakushita mitai da yo</i>

00:21:38.923 --> 00:21:48.016
<i>Sugu ni sugu ni kizuite hoshii, wakatte hoshii yo</i>

00:21:48.099 --> 00:22:02.489
<i>Sugu ni kimi ni kizuite hoshii,
kimi no kirei ni kizuite hoshii yo</i>

00:22:03.865 --> 00:22:08.328
Anata <i>ga</i> totemo kirei dakara

00:22:08.411 --> 00:22:12.415
Anata ni sore wo tsutaetai no sa

00:22:12.499 --> 00:22:22.091
<i>ltsumademo, itsumademo kimi utsukushisa wo</i>

00:22:22.175 --> 00:22:30.517
Anata <i>ga</i> jibun no utsukushisa ni
kizuitara boku <i>wa</i> shiawase nan da

00:22:30.600 --> 00:22:35.313
<i>Boku wa kimi wo omotteru yo</i>

00:22:35.396 --> 00:22:44.656
<i>Kimi no kirei ni kizuite okure</i>
